  "hero": "<section class=\"lr-hero\"><span class=\"lr-kicker\">LINEAR REGRESSION · OVERVIEW</span><h2>Fit a line to examples. Predict a new numerical value.</h2><p>Learn the relationship, test the errors, and check what the line can safely explain.</p><div class=\"lr-svg-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"House sales data point to a new price estimate using a fitted line\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"924\" height=\"324\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fcfdfe\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">HISTORICAL HOMES → LINE → PREDICTION</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"75\" width=\"264\" height=\"217\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eaf4fc\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154\" y=\"104\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">EXAMPLE PRICES</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"120\" width=\"201\" height=\"26\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154\" y=\"139\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">50 m² : $155k</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"150\" width=\"201\" height=\"26\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154\" y=\"169\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">75 m² : $195k</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"180\" width=\"201\" height=\"26\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154\" y=\"199\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">100 m² : $255k</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"210\" width=\"201\" height=\"26\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154\" y=\"229\" font-family=\"Arial,system-u