y=\"150.31\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#74b4cd\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"849.8\" cy=\"141.43\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#74b4cd\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M703.84 224.68 L743.2 196.93 L782.56 183.61 L820.28 150.31 L849.8 141.43\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dba16f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"776\" y=\"277\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">advertising → number</text></svg></div><p class=\"lr-note\">Linear regression learns relationships for <strong>continuous predictions</strong>.</p></section>",
      "options": [
        "It places every training example into fixed categories instead of predicting continuous numerical outcomes.",
