      "figure": "<section class=\"lr-figure\" data-scene=\"lr-03-house-scatter-line\"><span class=\"lr-kicker\">VISUAL EXPLANATION</span><h3>House size and the fitted price line</h3><div class=\"lr-svg-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"House size and the fitted price line\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"924\" height=\"324\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fcfdfe\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"469\" y=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">BEST-FIT LINE FOR HOUSE PRICES</text><rect x=\"21\" y=\"61\" width=\"602\" height=\"245\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"82\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"563\" y2=\"264\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"82\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"89\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M103.5 250.88 L555 78.68\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#67ad99\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"239.4\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"232.5\" cy=\"206.6\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"157.4\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"447.5\" cy=\"124.6\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"555\" cy=\"75.4\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"426\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"426\" y2=\"127.88\" stroke=\"#da9e6d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"426\" cy=\"127.88\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#da9e6d\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"648\" y=\"70\" width=\"269\" height=\"226\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eaf8ef\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"782\" y=\"111\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">NEW 120 m²</text><text x=\"782\" y=\"148\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">ŷ = 2×size + 51</text><rect x=\"698\" y=\"203\" width=\"168\" height=\"59\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"782\" y=\"239\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">$291k</text></svg></div><p class=\"lr-note\">Fit a line through the trend and estimate <strong>a new price</strong>.</p></section>",
      "options": [
        "It uses a straight line that minimizes squared errors before predicting prices for new sizes.",
        "It joins the two most expensive houses and assumes every other observation follows that segment.",
        "It averages all house prices without considering floor area or the direction of their relationship.",
        "It draws a separate independent curve through every house and memorizes their exact prices forever."
