      "tag": "Advanced",
      "stem": "What assumptions are important for reliable Linear Regression inference, including linearity, independence of errors, constant error variance (Homoscedasticity), and residual normality, and how can residual analysis reveal violations, outliers, and influential observations?",
      "figure": "<section class=\"lr-figure\" data-scene=\"lr-06-diagnostic-plots\"><span class=\"lr-kicker\">VISUAL EXPLANATION</span><h3>Check regression assumptions using residuals</h3><div class=\"lr-svg-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Check regression assumptions using residuals\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"924\" height=\"324\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fcfdfe\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"469\" y=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">RESIDUAL PLOTS DIAGNOSE ASSUMPTIONS</text><rect x=\"21\" y=\"61\" width=\"282\" height=\"243\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#edf5fb\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">CURVATURE</text><line x1=\"67\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"67\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"67\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"67\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#b5cbd4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"327\" y=\"61\" width=\"282\" height=\"243\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff3e6\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">FAN SPREAD</text><line x1=\"373\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"582\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"373\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"373\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"582\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#b5cbd4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"633\" y=\"61\" width=\"282\" height=\"243\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eaf8ef\" stroke=\"#d2e4e9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"774\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial,system-ui\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#426b80\">INFLUENTIAL POINT</text><line x1=\"679\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"888\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"679\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"679\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#94b4c0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"679\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"888\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#b5cbd4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"182\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"203.16026908252903\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"216.23803458662553\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"216.23803458662553\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"148\" cy=\"203.16026908252903\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"182\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"160.83973091747097\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"208\" cy=\"147.76196541337447\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"147.76196541337447\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"160.83973091747094\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"182\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#77b2c5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"364\" cy=\"170\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"391\" cy=\"175\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"418\" cy=\"192\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"221\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"472\" cy=\"134\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"499\" cy=\"163\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"526\" cy=\"204\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"553\" cy=\"257\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"364\" cy=\"170\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"391\" cy=\"175\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"418\" cy=\"192\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"221\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"472\" cy=\"134\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"499\" cy=\"163\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"526\" cy=\"204\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"553\" cy=\"257\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d5a071\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"704\" cy=\"181\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"728\" cy=\"190\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"752\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"776\" cy=\"181\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"800\" cy=\"190\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"824\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"848\" cy=\"181\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#68b398\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"881\" cy=\"123\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d8a06b\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></svg></div><p class=\"lr-note\">Curves, widening spread and unusual points can warn about <strong>bad assumptions</strong>.</p></section>",
      "options": [
        "Residual normality is necessary for every prediction, and any departure makes OLS coefficients invalid.",
        "A regression with independent errors can never contain extreme outliers, high leverage points, or influential observations.",
        "Residual plots can show no meaningful information about nonlinearity or unequal variance in fitted models.",
        "Residual plots can reveal nonlinearity, uneven error variance, outliers, and influential points affecting inference."
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "explanation": "<strong>In simple words:</strong> Residual plots show where predictions go wrong. Curved trends, widening spread, or unusual points can warn that assumptions are weak.",
      "technicalExplanation": "<strong>Detailed explanation:</strong> Linear conditional-mean specification, independence of errors, and exogeneity E[error|X]=0 matter for classic regression inference. Homoscedasticity is constant conditional error variance; violations affect usual standard errors and may call for robust alternatives. Normality of errors is relevant for exact small-sample inference, not required to calculate OLS predictions. Residuals-versus-fitted plots can reveal curvature or heteroscedasticity; time plots probe dependence, Q-Q plots distribution and Cook's distance influential points."
    },
